@startuml B-透明与溯源
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · B 透明与溯源（UC-SUB-B-01 ~ B-03）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · B 透明与溯源
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "供应商" as SUPPLIER
actor "商户" as MERCHANT
actor "消费者" as CONSUMER
actor "监管人员" as REGU

rectangle "B 透明与溯源" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-B-01 贯通全链溯源并标注断链" as B01
  usecase "UC-SUB-B-02 公开服务过程" as B02
  usecase "UC-SUB-B-03 公示抽检结果" as B03
}

SUPPLIER --> B01
MERCHANT --> B02
CONSUMER --> B01
CONSUMER --> B02
CONSUMER --> B03
REGU --> B01
REGU --> B03

note bottom of B01
  全链=农户生产→流通→终端→消费；农户端 M3 扩展（非确认角色）；
  M1 基础版由 T-08/T-09 承担
end note
@enduml
